    "endpoints": {
      "primary": "AUC(coherent) - AUC(diverse) on the FULL set. Koriat's consensuality principle predicts NEGATIVE: coherence raises confidence without raising accuracy, so the confidence-accuracy relationship degrades where the evidence agrees with itself. AUC(coherent) below 0.5 is the crossover.",
